OL,3,ARockstar Games breaks silence on Grand
OL,4,ATheft Auto 6 leaks
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 maker Rockstar Games
OL,7,Fhas issued a statement addressing a
OL,8,Fseries of leaked videos showing the
OL,9,Fupcoming blockbuster video game.
OL,11,FClips appearing to show gameplay and
OL,12,Fcinematics from the title began
OL,13,Fappearing online last week, but the
OL,14,Fdeveloper did not acknowledge them
OL,15,Fstraight away.
OL,17,FIn a statement, the company said the
OL,18,Fleaks had been "heartbreaking" for the
OL,19,Fteam working on the sequel, and that
OL,20,Fthey were "not how we intended for you
OL,21,Fto see the game after all this time".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
